---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Base title="Responsible disclosure">
  <PageHero title="Responsible disclosure" intro="How to report a security vulnerability in my tools, datasets or this website." crumbs={[{ label: 'Responsible disclosure', href: '/responsible-disclosure/' }]} />
  <section><div class="wrap"><div class="prose">
<p>I take the security of my open-source tools and infrastructure seriously. If you believe you have found a vulnerability, please let me know privately.</p>
<h2>How to report</h2>
<ul><li>Email me at <a href="mailto:AutonomousCyber-CybersecuriteAutonome@nrc-cnrc.gc.ca">AutonomousCyber-CybersecuriteAutonome@nrc-cnrc.gc.ca</a> with the subject <strong>Security disclosure</strong>, or open a private security advisory on the relevant GitHub repository.</li><li>Include steps to reproduce, affected versions and potential impact.</li><li>Please do not disclose the issue publicly until I have had a reasonable time to fix it.</li></ul>
<h2>Our commitment</h2>
<p>I will acknowledge your report within 5 working days, keep you updated, and credit you (if you wish) once the issue is fixed. <em>(Placeholder policy. Review before publishing.)</em></p>
  </div></div></section>
</Base>
